        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Atwanare a Saul ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu Ŋipilistin ŋulu aŋaarito ajore kitijikis Ŋisirael; tobwaŋas Ŋisirael, toarakis Ŋipilistin ikes ŋulu alalak lomukura ŋolo a Gilboa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Toditasi Ŋipilistin Saul ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa. Toara ikes ŋidwe a Saul ŋulusapa lu: Yonasan ka Abinadab ta Maliki-Sua. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Topotyor ejie nooi aneni ayai Saul; toditasi iŋes ŋulu atiŋito ŋikaleŋeleŋe, apotu towana iŋes nooi a ŋikaleŋeleŋe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tema nai Saul neni a ekile a ŋolo aryoŋit ŋiboro keŋ ŋulu ke ejie, “Tolemu ekileŋ kon ikicumya ayoŋ, ikotere nyepotu ŋituŋa ŋul ŋulu nyileŋeritae akicum ayoŋ, ido okokyenatar.” Nai abu ŋolo aryoŋit ŋiboro a Saul ŋulu ke ejie nyecamu akicum Saul, anerae eilit iŋes. Aŋun, abu Saul tolemu ekileŋ keŋ a elope, toramakin lokileŋ, kicumakin bon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iŋolikini ŋolo aryoŋit ŋiboro a Saul ŋulu ke ejie atemar eridak Saul, toramakin iŋes daŋ lokileŋ keŋ a elope kicumakin bon totwaka ikes kaapei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, apotu Saul ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa ŋiuni ka ŋolo aryoŋit ŋiboro keŋ ŋulu ke ejie ta ŋikajiok ŋulu arukito ka iŋes daadaŋ totwaka akoloŋit apei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iŋolikinete Ŋisirael ŋulu ayakasi nakadipaalat atemar abwaŋasi ŋikajiok ka aari Saul ka ŋidwe keŋ ŋulusapa, apotu kimyekis ŋitaunio kec, toema nariet. Apotu nai Ŋipilistin potu toloma lotaunio ŋul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani akoloŋit ŋina atupakini ŋin, toloto Ŋipilistin akilac ŋituŋa ŋulu aris ikes keara ŋul. Toryamut akuwan a Saul ka ŋuna a ŋidwe keŋ a ŋulusapa a ŋuluuni eperete alomukura a ŋolo a Gilboa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolaca ikes Saul, totubosi akou, ido yaasi kaapei ka aupal keŋ, kiyakiyasi ŋituŋa nakwap a Ŋipilistin daadaŋ alimor ŋakiro ŋuna ajokak ŋuna ka akiloun a ŋin; ikotere elimoryo ŋakiro ŋun anakais a ŋakujo kec ka lotuŋa kec daadaŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiwuakis Ŋipilistin aupal a Saul kai a ŋakujo kec, ido toenikis akou keŋ kai ka akuj a ŋina anyaritae Dagon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ani iirarete ŋituŋa ŋulu a Yabes-Gilead ŋakiro daadaŋ ŋuna kitiyata Ŋipilistin neni a Saul, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tonyout ŋikilyok a Yabes-Gilead daadaŋ ŋulu adedeŋak, tolemut akuwan a Saul ka ŋuna a ŋidwe keŋ a ŋulusapa, yaut Yabes. Tonukakis kwap ekitoe ŋolo ayai Yabes ŋolo apolon nooi ŋolo esibit ekwaakwaa, ido kiredakis akiron ŋirwa ŋikanikaarei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Saul totwana, anerae pa ekinyomit iŋes Akuj; pa ewuapit iŋes ŋakiro ŋuna ke Ekapolon, abu daŋ tolot neni a ŋimurok aanyun ŋuna kitiyakina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abu nyiŋit Ekapolon ŋuna kitiyakina. Aŋun, abu Ekapolon kimyek iŋes totwan, ido abu Ekapolon inak Daudi lokoku a Yese toruwor ekepukan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
